---
import ContentLayout from "../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
import { HOME } from "../../utils/breadcrumbs";
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Data Career Hub is educational. Content can become outdated, company interview material is evidence-labelled, and nothing here guarantees an interview or job outcome."
  crumbs={[HOME, { label: "Disclaimer" }]}
  eyebrow="Legal"
  indexable
>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Educational purpose</h2>
      <p>
        Everything on this site is for learning and interview preparation. It is not professional,
        legal or financial advice.
      </p>
      <h2>Content may become outdated</h2>
      <p>
        Data platforms change quickly. Each page shows when it was last reviewed and, where it
        matters, which version it describes. Always verify against current vendor documentation
        before making production decisions.
      </p>
      <h2>Company interview material</h2>
      <p>
        Company guides label every item as verified or attributed, reported, or a representative
        practice question. Representative questions are written by us and are not claims about what
        any company has asked. Interview processes change and differ between teams.
      </p>
      <h2>No guarantees</h2>
      <p>We do not guarantee interviews, offers, salaries or any particular career outcome.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate and sponsored content</h2>
      <p>
        The site currently contains no affiliate links or sponsored content. If that changes,
        affected pages will say so clearly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
